  "description": "87 Paines Lane",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The applicant has failed to demonstrate, in accordance with Section 192(2) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended), that the proposed works associated with the conversion of the site into a nursery (Use Class E(f)) would not constitute development under Section 55(2) of the Act. On the balance of probability, insufficient evidence has been provided to confirm that a previous planning permission (ref: P/1629/03/CFU) was never implemented, and that its associated conditions no longer apply. Therefore, the application for a Certificate of Lawful Development (Proposed) is refused."
  ],
